      "message": "Yes...for sure...which is the main directive.\n\nPart of my Build Inclusion Directory Reduction Effort, or BIDRE (?)\n\n```\n$ find . -name bt_target.h\n./internal_include/bt_target.h\n$ ls -1 internal_include/\nAndroid.bp\nbte_appl.h\nbt_target.h\nbt_trace.h\nstack_config.h\n```\n\nI think there are better ways to parse/distribute the data contained here so I don\u0027t mind expanding the file inclusion to use `internal_include` and remove `internal_include` from Android.bp files.\n\nThen as the individual data pieces contained within each compilation unit that depend on `internal_include/*.h` get moved the deps list gets smaller until all of this can be removed.",
